<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Ndonde Hamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Bhaloma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngani Jammbone jijijaandikwe na Apaulo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bhaloma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bhal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani Jammbone handa chiijandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Apaulo</para>
  <para style="imt">Nnongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu heche cha Bhaloma komboleka chikajandikwa na Andundame Apaulo muuda teno pakati ja chaka cha 54 na 58 baada ja kubhelekwa kwa Akilisito. Apaulo akibha tangu jwangatyangila chilambo cha ku Loma henela akaajandikilanga chitabu chenjeni ili kwaalagianga bhandu bhabhahobhalile Akilisito bhabhakatamanga chilambo cha ku Loma, Bhayahudi na bhanga Bhayahudi. Apaulo akajandika chitabu hecho akibha ku chilambo cha ku Kolinto kubhatendita kutama gono muda. Akajandika ili bhandu bha hilambo yoha bhakombolange kwahobhalela na kwaajoanikia Ayesu Kilisito mu chula ja 16:26</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Bhaloma nga chammbone muno kwa lilubhalo lya bhandu lilyahobhalela Akilisito bha kila maali na kwa muda goa ligongo lya henela Apaulo chibhatendakongolela kwa ndaa na kwa kuaminika kwa ngani ya kuokolewa kutukombola kupata kupetela Ayesu Kilisitio. Apaulo kabhele akakombola kuhilondanika Ngani Jammbone ja Ayesu Kilisito na Lilagano lya lolo. Akaachomi bhajingi bhatendakutaukananga kubhee moomba jammbone muno mu heche chitabu nga chula ja 1:16 gugulobhola, “Ngajibhonela honi Ngani Jammbone, ligongo nga uwecho gwa Annoongo guguokoa kwa kila bhabhahobhalela, kujemeka kwa Bhayahudi, ngapena kwa Bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi.” Mu chula ja 1-12 Chehemu ja kujemeka ja Bhaloma jikongolela majigano kwa ngani ja kwaamanya Annoongo, mu chula ja 13-15 chehemu ja bhele, Andundame atekujandika chitabu chenjeni kwa hikubho kwa umomi gwa bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabhile</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo ajemeka kujandika chitabu heche kuchikongolea na kulobhola nga aganiki jwaatenda kwaajandikila mu chula ja 1:1-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Helahela Apaulo atendakujandika kwa ngani ja mundu chibhabhile mundu jwalemwite na kuokolewa kwabhe kukukomboleka kupetela Ayesu Kilisito mu chula ja 1:16, 11:36.</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo atendakuhatambula henela chibhapalikwa kutenda na kutamanga kwa lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito mu chula ja 12:1-15:13.</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo atendakujomolekea kujandika kwa kwaasalimianga lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bha chilambo cha ku Loma mu chula ja 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Nenga Apaulo, antumichi bha Akilisito Ayesu, andundame ndekuhagulikwa na kukemwa ligongo lya kutangacha Ngani Jammbone. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Pena lolo, Annoongo akatandubha kwaakongolela apakwapekeanga Ngani Jammbone kupetela malobhe ga akaalondoi bhabhe mu Majaandiko Gakwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Jenje Ngani Jammbone jitendakwaakongolela Mwana jwa Annoongo, Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito, jwaakabhelekwa handa mundu chaabhelekwa, akibha jwa ubhelei gwa Adaudi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />kwa ngani ja hikubho ya Annoongo. Akalangikwa kwa uwecho nkolongwa kubhee nga Mwana jwa Annoongo kwa kuyokekwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Kupetela jonojwe Ayesu Kilisito, Annoongo atekumbekea umbone gwabhe kubhee andundame, ili ligongo lyabhe, naatandaange bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhapatange kuhobhalelanga na kujeketela. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Mwangota nga nkati ya bhandu bhenabho, nkemitingwe na Annoongo mme bhandu bhabhe Ayesu Kilisito bhene.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Bahi, ndenda kunnyandikilanga mwangota mwabhoa bhammilinge ku Loma yakubhee Annoongo atenda kumpalanga muno, akanhagulanga mmee bhandu bhabhe mwene. Ndendakujopa kwa Hangwana Annoongo na Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito ampekeange mwangota umbone gwabhe.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakwaachukulu Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Henela kwa kujemeka, ndenda kwaachukulu Annoongo jwangu kwa kupetela Ayesu Kilisito ligongo lya mwangota mwabhoa, kwa kubhee kuhobhalela kwinu kutendakumanyikana pachilambo poha. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Annoongo junantumikila kwa ntima gwangu goa mu kutangacha Ngani Jammbone ja mwana jwabhe, jonojwe nga jwaalola na kuimanya chinankombokelanga machobha goa mu kujopa kwangu. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Ndendakwaajopa Annoongo handa apalite, ambekee upenyo gwa kuhalala gwa kuntyangilanga. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Kwa kubhee ndenda kulokolila muno kummonanga na kwajangatilanga mpatange ngwahupa ja mboomo ili mmangange na machili mu kuhobhelela. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Chinongela pambani, mwangota na nenga tupakujangatilana machobha goa, kuhobhalela kwinu kupakunekela machili nenga, na kuhobhalela kwangu kupakunnekelanga machili mwangota mu kwahobhalela Ayesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Akaalongo bhangu bhandu bhamwahobhalela Ayesu, mbala muhimanyange kubhee mala jijingi ngapalikwa kuntyangilanga, nambo kukibha na hilebhe hijingi hitekunhibhila kuhika kwaachinunji. Mbaalite bhandu bhaamanye Ayesu pakati jinunji mwangota handa paahikibha kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Nenga mbalikwa kwaatangachianga bhandu bhoa Ngani Jammbone, Bhagiliki na bhanga Bhagiliki, kwa bhabhachomitinge na bhangachomanga. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Henela ndenda kulokolila kabhele kutangacha Ngani Jammbone kwaachinunji mwangota mmilinge konokwe ku Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Machili ga Ngani Jammbone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Ngalola oni kutangacha Ngani Jammbone, ligongo Ngani Jammbone jibhii na machili ga Annoongo gagaaokoanga bhoa bhabhahobhalelanga Ayesu, kujemekela na Bhayahudi na bhanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Henela Ngani Jammbone jilangia namuna Annoongo chitupalikwa tubhee ili tukondekwe nnoongo jabhe, chikubho heche chitendeka kwa kuhobhalela, kujemeka kandahi mpaka kupela, handa chijijaandikwe mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo, “Mundu jwakondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo apakutama kwa kutandaikwa mu kuhobhalela.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulemwa kwa bhandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Lilaka lya Annoongo litekulangikwa pandaa kwa bhenibhala bhoa bhabhaakana yakubhee bhabhakananga ukweli kwa ubohu gwabhenji gukotokumanyikana. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Hikubho hiikombola kumanyikana kwa ngani ja Annoongo, kwa kubhee Annoongo mwene abhekite pandaa kwabhenji. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Kubhokela Annoongo pabhakahalakia chilambo uwecho gwabhe gwa machobha goa pangali kupela na unnoongo gwabhe gumanyikana pandaa hata handa ngabhonekana kwa mio. Bhandu bhakombolanga kugumanya kwa hilebhe yakubhee Annoongo akahialakia. Henela bhandu bhoa bhanga ndela joha jela ja kuchitetea! <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Bhena bhandu hata handa bhamanyanga kubhee Annoongo abhile, nambo ngaatopea handa chiipalikwa, wala ngaachukulu. Badala jakwe, kuganikia kwabhenji kutwelilinge mabohu na luunda lwabhenji gumanyahopo chilebhe. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Bhachitenda kubhee bhakolite malango, nambo bhamanyangahopo chilebhe. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Bhalekanga kwaachalila Annoongo jwaatama machobha goa pangali kupela, nambo bhachalilanga hidimu hiilandana na mundu jwaajomoka, kulandanikia na hinyama, hijuni na hinyama hiikwabha. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Henela Annoongo bhatekwaalekanga bhakagulange kulokolila kubohu kwa mitima yabhenji, na kutendelana hikubho ya oni kupetela mimele jabhenji. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Bhagutendebhua ukweli gwa Annoongo kubhee unami, bhatenda kuchalilanga na kuitumikilanga hilebhe hialakikwe na Annoongo, na kuleka kwaachalila Annoongo mwene jwaatekuhalakia, jwapalikwa kulumbalilwa machobha goa! Na hibhee henela. <verse eid="ROM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Henela Annoongo akabhalekanga bhakagulange kulokolila kwabhenji kubohu na kwa oni. Hata akahikege bhakatekulekanga kutenda handa chiiyobhalilike ja kulombwa na akanalome nambo bhatendakulombelana akaachinabhenenji. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Akanalome hiyoyo bhatendakulekanga kutumianga yeega yabhenji handa chiipalikwa kwa mwanalome na mwikege, na akanalome bhatendelananga hikubho ya oni, kwa kutenda henela Annoongo apakwahukumulanga kubhokana na hikubho yabhenji hibohu. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Bhandu bhakakananga kwaamanya Annoongo, Annoongo atekwaalekanga bhakagulange kuganikia kwabhenji kubohu, bhakatendange genigala gangapalikwa kutenda. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Bhakibhanga na kila namuna ja ubohu, kwaapokonyola bhandu hilebhe, na kulyee muno, na kukwetela hilebhe. Bhenangota nga bhandu bha bwiu, na kukoma, na abulwa, na akaanami, na kuganikia kubohu, na kung'wenya bhandu, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />bhandu bha kopokeananga, nga bhandu bha kwaachimwa Annoongo, bhandu bha mbwinya na bhakuchipuna, ngajogopanga kutenda mabohu, na ngaatopeanga akaabhelei bhabhenji, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />bhena bhandu nga akaajinga, bhangahobhalelanga, bhanga kiha na bhabhatendelanga mabohu bhangi. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Bhamanyanga kubhee malagilo ga Annoongo galagia bhandu bhabhatamanga kulandana na henela, bhapalikwa kujomoka. Kupunda ja genago, ngabha bhatendanga hikubho yeneyo akaachinabhene jika, ila bhakondekana na bhenaangota bhabhatendanga hikubho heyo.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuhukumula kwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Bahi, aganja handa ntenda kwaahukumula bhandu bhangi, ngombola kuchitetela, hata nkibha mwenga nga aganiki. Kwa kwaahukumula bhangi, ntenda kuchihukumula mwe mwachinabhene kwa kubhee namwenga ntenda galagala chinhukumula bhangi. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Tuhimanyi kubhee hukumulo ja Annoongo kwa bhenibhala bhabhatendanga hikubho handa yeneyo nga hukumulo ja kweli. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Nambo mwenga chintendakwahukumulanga bhenibhala bhabhatenda hikubho handa yeneyo kubhee na kongo mwenga ntenda helahela, bholi ng'anikia mpakuchibheka kutali na hukumu ja Annoongo? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Au mwenga ntenda kugubhelua umbone nkolongwa gwa Annoongo, kuchitimalika kwabhe na kulendela kwabhe, nkoto kuhimanya kubhee umbone gonogwe gwa Annoongo gutenda kunhuta nkombole kuleka mabohu na kwaatendebhukila Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Nambo mwenga ngajoa na ntendakana kuleka mabohu. Ntendakuchibhekela lilaka, kwa lichobha lyela lya lilaka na uhunukulo gwa hukumu ja kweli ja Annoongo pajipakulangikwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Lichobha lyenelyo Annoongo apakwaalepa kila mundu kubhokana na hikubho yabhe. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Annoongo apakumpekeannga umomi gwa machobha goa gwangapela, bhenibhala bhabhachitahidi kutenda gammbone, kwakubhee bhalolea kutopewa na ukolo na umomi gwangapela. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Nambo bhenibhala bhangi bhabhabhilinge na uchinabhene, bhabhii na kukananga hikubho ya kweli na kukagula ubohu, Annoongo apakwatumbalila na kwaalagianga handa chiipalikwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Kupakubhee kulaga na kubhina kwa mundu joajola jwaatenda mabohu. Kupakwaapatanga Bhayahudi oti na kabhele kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Nambo Annoongo apakwatendanga bhalumbalilwe na kwatenda bhatopelwange na kutongamanika kwa bhenibhala bhabhatendanga gammbone, Bhayahudi oti, kabhele bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />kwa kubhee Annoongo atendakuhukukumula bhandu henela chiipalikwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Bhandu bhoa bhanga Bhayahudi bhabhatendanga gabohu panga kugamanya Malagilo ga Amusa bhagapekiwe na Annoongo bhapakuhumulwanga hata handa ngamanyanga Malagilo genago. Na bhenibhala bhandu bhabhatendanga gabohu kongo bhagamanyanga Malagilo ga Amusa bhapakuhukumulwa kupetela Malagilo genago. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ngabha bhenibhala bhabhajohanga Malagilo nga bhabhakondekwa na Annoongo. Nambo bhenibhala bhabhagakamula na kujeketela Malagilo nga bhabhakondekwa na Annoongo kubhee bhammbone. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhakwetingehopo Malagilo, nambo pabhatendanga kwa hikubho hiipalikwa mu malagilo, bhenabho akaachinabhene bhatendakubhee malagilo hata handa bhagamanyaopo malagilo ga Amusa. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Hikubho yabhenji hilangia kubhee gagapalikwa mu malagilo gatekujandikwa mu mitima yabhenji. Mu mitima jabhenji jilangia handa jenejo nga kweli, kwa kubhee kuganikia kwabhenji kutenda kwalangia handa bhatendanga gammbone au bhatendanga gangali mmbone. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Henela, kagulana na jenje Ngani Jammbone jinitendakuntangachianga, nga chiipakubhee machobha gala Annoongo pabhapakuhukumula hikubho ya bhandu hiitekuchiiya, kwa ndela ja Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhayahudi na Malagilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Mwenga mwabhene nchikema Anyahudi, ntenda kugakulupalila Malagilo na kuchipunila kubhee mundu jwa Annoongo, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />kwa kujiganwa na malagilo mugamanyi gabhapala Annoongo na nkombola kuhagula chikubho chichipalikwa kupanganwa, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />mwenga nchibhona kubhee anachilongola bha bhabhangalola na nhana kwa bhenibhala bhabhabhile mu lubhendu, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />nchibhona kubhee bhannyigana bha akaajinga na bhannyigana bha bhenibhala bhandu bhangamanyanga ukweli gwa kuhobhalela, kwa kubhee mmi na umanyo gwa ukweli gwa malagilo genago. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Bahi, mwenga ntenda kwajigana bhangi, kwa niki ngachijigana mwachinabhene? Ntenda kwatangachianga bhangi bhakoto kujibha, nambo mwabhene ntenda kujibha? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Mwenga nnobhola, “Nkoto kutendanga ngongola,” na kongo mwenga ntenda hela hela, ntenda kuhichimwa hidimu ya minnoongo kongo mwenga mwabhene ntenda kujibha hilebhe kubhoka mu nyuumba ya kuchalila minnoongo jenejo? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Ntendakuchilumbalila kubhee nkweti Malagilo ga Annoongo, nambo ntendakwaabhelua Annoongo kwa kuleka kujeketela Malagilo gabhe? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Majandiko ga Annoongo galobhola, “Bhandu bha hilambo yeengi bhatendakwatukana Annoongo ligongo linunji Bhayahudi.” <verse eid="ROM 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Kuhinwa kwinu kupakubhee kwammbone handa mpakugakamula malagilo, nambo handa ngakamulanga Malagilo, mbaya nkatamitinge panga kuhinwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Handa mundu jwanga Anyahudi jwangahinwa handa atamite kwa kukagula Malagilo ga Amusa, Annoongo atendakwaakonda handa atekuhinwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Bhandu bha hilambo yeengi bhapakunhukumula mwenga mwa Anyahudi handa nnekite kugakagula malagilo, hata handa nkweti majandiko ga malagilo na ntekuhinwa, nambo bhenaangota bhatenda kugajeketela malagilo kongo bhabhi bhangahinwanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Henela, ngabha kila mundu jwaabhelikwe na Anyahudi apakubhee Anyahudi bha kweli na mundu ngakombola kubhee Anyahudi bha kweli kwa kuhinwa payega. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Mundu jwaakondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo nga jonijola jwaatenda gabhagapala jonojwe, na kuhinwa kwa kweli nga konikola kukutendwa muntima na Mboomo ja Annoongo ngabha kwa kukagula Malagilo. Mundu handa jonojwe atendakulumbalilwa, ngabha kubhoka kwa bhandu, nambo kubhoka kwa Annoongo.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Anyahudi apakupata chiniki muno? Au kutekubhee na chikubho niki chammbone chibhapata mundu kwa kuhinwa? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Nga kweli, kubhee Anyahudi kutekubhee nga chikubho chammbone chikolongwa, kwa kubhee, Annoongo akaakamuanga oti Bhayahudi malobhe gakwe. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Nambo hipakubhee bholi, handa Bhayahudi bhangi ngahobhalelanga? Bholi, kwa kuleka kuhobhalela kwabhenji kupakwaatenda Annoongo akotokulupalilwa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Hopo! Annoongo nga jwa kulupalilwa machobha goa, hata handa kila mundu nga anami. Handa Majandiko ga Annoongo chiijaandikwe mu Majandiko ga Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“Muda goa pannobhola malobhe ginu nga ga kweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">mu kuhukumulwa mwenga ntendakuchinda.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Handa ubohu gwitu gupakulangia kubhee Annoongo atenda gagapalikwa, tupakulobhola chiniki? Bholi, Annoongo handa apakutuhukumula tupakulobhola kubhee atendakutubhonela? Pambani ndendakulongela handa mundu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Hopo! Handa Annoongo akibhaopo jwa kulupalilwa, akakombwile bholi kwahukumulanga bhandu bha pa chilambo?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Kabhele bhandu bhakongombola kulongela kubhee, kutokuhobhalelwa kwitu kwaatenda bhandu bhangi bhalolange ndaa kubhee Annoongo nga jwakuaminika, na bhenaangota bhapakupunda kwaatukucha. Nangocheni kwaniki tangu tutenda kuhukumulwa handa tupangana mabohu? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Kono nga kulobhola kubhee, “Tupalikwa kupangana mabohu ili gammbone gahike?” Bhandu bhangi bhatendakutukopokea kwa kutuhukumula kubhee tutekujiganwa henela. Bhenaangota bhapalikwa kuhukumulwa kubhokana na mabohu gabhenji.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhoa bhatendite gabohu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Bahi tulobhole chiniki, bholi, twenga Bhayahudi nga bhammbone kupeta bhangi? Ngabha hopo! Handa chindekunnobholelanga kubhokela kandahi kubhee Bhayahudi na bhanga Bhayahudi bhoa bhabhi pahi ja utabhala gwa mabohu. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Handa Majaandiko ga Annoongo chigalobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">Jwakwa hata jumo jwaapangana gagaabhajila Annoongo,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Jwaka mundu hata jumo jwabhii na luunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">wala jwaannolea Annoongo.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Bhandu bhoa bhatekwaaleka Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">bhoa bhabhi handa bhatekubhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">jwakwa jwaatenda gagapalikwa na Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">jwaka hata jumo.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Malobhe gabhenji nga ga unami handa likabuli lyangawekelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">lulimi lwabhenji lutwelile unami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">mu kang'wa yabhenji gabhoka malobhe gagabhii na uchoongo handa ga lijoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Kang'wa yabhenji hitwelile malobhe ga kulaani na ga kwaahulaa bhangi.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Bhena bhandu bhatendanga chindema kujaula kwakomanga akaajabhe,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Poha pala pabhajenda bhatenda kualibiana hilebhe na bhatendakwaalekanga bhandu na hibhini,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />wala ngakombola kutama bhandu bhangi kwa kuhengwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Wala ngaatopea Annoongo hata kachoko.<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Nangocheni tuhimanyi kubhee choachela chichibhii mu Malagilo ga Amusa, gatenda kwakongolela bhandu bhabhapokilinge Malagilo genago, hata ngakombolanga kubhee na chikopokeo choachela, na chilambo choa chibhii pahi ja hukumulo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Bhakwa mundu bhoa bhala bhabhakondekwa na Annoongo kwa kugakamula Malagilo ga Amusa, lihengo lya Malagilo nga kunangia mundu kubhee bhatendite mabohu.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kondekwa na Annoongo kwa ndela ja kuhobhalela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Nambo nangocheni, ndela ja Annoongo ja kwaakondeka bhandu kubhee bhammbone jibhekitwe pandaa, kabhele pangali kulupalila Malagilo. Malagilo ga Amusa na Majandiko ga akaalondohi bha Annoongo galangia chikubho chenecho. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Ndela jenejo nga ja kwahobhalela Ayesu Kilisito, Annoongo atenda henela kwa bhoa bhabhahobhalela, kwaakwa kubagulana pakati ja Bhayahudi na bhanga Bhayahudi, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />kwa kubhee bhandu bhoa bhabhatenditinge gabohu na kupongokelwa kutopelwa na Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Nambo kwa ngwahupa ja Annoongo bhandu bhoa bhakondekwa kubhee bhammbone kwa ndela ja Ayesu Kilisito jwatekutukomboa. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Annoongo akaapia Ayesu, ili kwa mihai jabhe, abhee ndela ja kwaabhokea bhandu mabohu gabhenji kwa kuhobhalela kwabhenji. Akatenda henela ili akombole kulangia kubhee jonojwe nga jwammbone. Pena lolo Annoongo akibha bhakuchitimalika akachitenda handa ngalola kulemwa kwa bhandu. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Akatenda henela ili kulangia chibhabhile jwammbone nangocheni, ili abhee jwaammbone na abhatendange bhandu bhakondekwange na ndela ja Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Bahi, tukombola kuchipunila chiniki? Chaakwa chakuchipunila! Kwa niki? Bholi, ligongo lya kugakamula Malagilo? Ngabha! Ila kwa ndela ja kwaahobhalela Ayesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Maana Annoongo atenda kunkonda mundu kubhee jwammbone nnoongi jabhe kwa kwahobhalela Ayesu, wala ngabha kwa kutenda chiipalikwa na Malagilo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Bholi, Annoongo nga Annoongo jwa Bhayahudi jikajabhe, au jwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi? Eloo, jwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi kabhele. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Annoongo nga jumo, na jonojwe apakwakondanga Bhayahudi kubhee bhammbone nnoongi jabhe kwa kuhobhalela kwabhenji, na bhandu bha hilambo yeengi apakwaakonda kwa kuhobhalela kwabhenji. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Bholi, ng'anikia kubhee tubhoa malagilo na kubheka kuhobhalela kongoni? Ngabha hopo! Kwa kuhobhalela kupaangana chenichela chichipalikwa na Malagilo.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia kwa Aibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Bahi tulobhole niki, kwa ngani ja aokolo bhitu Aaibulahimu, jonojwe akombwile bholi kuhimanya hikubho heye? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Handa Aaibulahimu akibha akondikwe nnoongi ja Annoongo kubhee jwammbone ligongo lya hikubho yabhe, bahi, akweti na chilebhe cha kuchipunila nnoongi ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Majandiko ga Annoongo galobhola, “Aaibulahimu akaahobhalela Annoongo, na bhena Annoongo akaakonda kubhee jwammbone.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Nambo kwa mundu jwapangana lihengo, malepo gabhe ngabhalanganikwa kubhee nga gwahupa, ila kubhee nga ligambo. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Nambo mundu jwangakulupalila hikubho yabhe bhene, ila atenda kwaahobhalela Annoongo, jwabhalekelela akaabohu, bahi, Annoongo abhajilwa na jono mundu, na kondekwa na jono kubhee jwammbone. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Jono Adaudi akalobhola hela hela pabhakalobhola kwa ngani ja kuhangalala kwa mundu jonijola jwatekondeekwa na Annoongo kubhee jwammbone pangali kuhilola hikubho yabhe,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Bhatendakuhangalala bhenibhala bhandu yakubhee Annoongo atekwaalekelelanga mabohu gabhenji</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">na mabohu gabhenji atekugahuta.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Apakuhangalala muno mundu jola yakubhee Hangwana ngakombokela mabohu gabhe.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Bholi, kuhangalala konokwe kubhakalobhola Adaudi nga ligongo lya bhenibhala Bhayahudi bhabhainitingwe jikajabhenji, au kabhele kwa bhenibhala bhangahinwangwa? Tukalobhola, “Aaibulahimu akaahobhalela Annoongo na kuhobhalela kwabhe Annoongo akaakonda Aaibulahimu.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Bholi, Aaibulahimu akakondeekwa kwa Annoongo tangu ja kuhinwa, au pabhakahinwa? Akaakondekwa abhitangu kwaahina, na ngabha pabhakahika. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Aaibulahimu akahinwa pagakapeta genago, na kuhinwa konokwe kukibha kulangia kubhee Annoongo akakoonda nnoongi jabhe kubhee jwammbone ligongo lya kuhobhalela kwabhe kubhakibha nako tangu ja kuhinwa. Henela, Aibulahimu atekubhee atati bha bhenibhala bhoa yakubhee hata handa bhakibhanga bhangahinwa nambo bhatekwaahobhalela Annoongo na akaatendanga kubhee bhammbone. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Hela hela Aaibulahimu nga atati bha bhenibhala bhabhatekuhinwa, nambo ngabha kwa kubhee bhatekuhinwanga, ila ligongo bhakagulanga ndela jelajela ja kuhobhalela yakubhee atati bhitu Aaibulahimu akajikagula tangu ja kuhinwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Genigala gabhakalobhola Annoongo apakutupekea gatendapokelewa kwa kuhobhalela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Annoongo akaalobholela Aaibulahimu na chibhelei chabhe kubhee chilambo chikabhee chabhenji. Akaalobholela henela ngabha kwa kubhee Aibulahimu akakonda Malagilo ga Amusa, ila kwa kubhee akahobhalela kubhee apakondekwa kwa Annoongo kubhee jwammbone. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Bhabhapekewa genago gabhakalobhola Annoongo nga kwa bhenibhala bhabhakagula Malagilo ga Amusa, bahi kuhobhalela kwanga maana kohakola, na genigala gabhalongile Annoongo ngabha chilebhe. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Malagilo ga Amusa galeta lilaka lya Annoongo, kwa kubhee panga Malagilo kwaakwa kulemwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Chikubho heche chitendakulupalila kuhobhalela, henela genigala gabhakalobhola apakutupekea gabhokana na umbone gwa Annoongo, na kubhee nga kweli genigala gabhakalobhola Annoongo apakutupekea nga ligongo lya bhoa, ngabha kwa bhenibhala tu bhabhagakamula Malagilo, ila kwa bhenibhala kabhele bhabhatamanga kwa kuhobhalela handa Aaibulahimu. Jonojwe nga atati bhitu twenga twabhoa. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Handa Majandiko ga Annoongo chigajandikwe, “Ndekummeka mme atati bha bhandu bha hilambo hijingi.” Malobhe genego nga ga kweli nnoongi ja Annoongo yakubhee Aaibulahimu akaahobhalela Annoongo yakubhee atendakwaayoanga bhabhawilinge, na kwa kutenda hilebhe yangabhee hitenda kubhee. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Aaibulahimu akahobhalela na kulupalila hata handa kukongopala kwabhe kukaatenda kuhengeleka ntima, henela atekubhee atati bha bhandu bha hilambo hijingi, itekujandikwa mu Majandiko ga Annoongo, “Akaabhelei bhinu bhapakubhee bhajingi handa ndondwa!” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Aaibulahimu akibha anahota kubhandikila na yaaka mia jimo, nambo kwahobhalela kwabhe Annoongo kwangapongoa hata handa akagahimanya kubhee mmele gwabhe gukibha handa gutekuwee, na hata hanu bhabhe Asala, akibha ntoonga. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Nambo Aaibulahimu jwangabhee na lipamba kwa ngani jenijela jibhakalobholelwa na Annoongo, ila akalekelelwa machili mu kuhobhalela na kwaalumbalila Annoongo, <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />kongo abhikuhimanya kubhee Annoongo akibha na uwecho gwa kutenda genigala gabhaalobholile. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Chenecho nga chikubho chichikaatenda Annoongo kwakonda Aaibulahimu kubhee jwammbone. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Malobhe gangani, gagalobhola, “Annoongo akaakonda kubhee jwammbone.” Gangajaandikwa ligongo lya Aaibulahimu jikajabhe, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />ila nga ligongo litu tweenga twabhoa yakubhee Annoongo apakututenda tukondekwee na jonojwe, twenga twaahobhalela jonojwe jwatekwayoha Hangwana bhitu Ayesu. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Annoongo akaabhoka Ayesu ili akomekwe ligongo lya mabohu gitu, na akaayoa ili atutende tukondekwe na Annoongo.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kubhee maganja na Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Nangocheni, kwa kubhee tutekondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo kwa kuhobhalela, mmangange na kuhengwa na Annoongo kwa ndela ja Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Kwa kwahobhalela Ayesu, Annoongo atupekie umbone gwabhe. Nangocheni tutendakutama mu umbone gwabhe. Tutendakuhangalala muno kwa kubhee tutendakulupalila kubhee tupakubhee pamo na Annoongo mu ukolo gwabhe. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ngabha henela tu, ila tutenda kuhangalala kabhele mu kulaga, ligongo tuhimanyi kubhee kulaga kuleta kwanga kujogopa, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />kwanga kujogopa kututenda tubhee na machili ga kuhobhalela na machili ga kuhobhalela galeta kuhobhalela, <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />kulupalila konokwe ngatuhengela ntima, ligongo Annoongo atekutupekea mu mitima jitu upalyo gwabhe kupetela Mboomo ja Annoongo.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Patukalepela kuchihokoa akaachinabhene, nambo machobha pagakahika, Akilisito akawee ligongo litu twenga tutubhii na mabohu. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Kweli, nga kulimba muno mundu joajola kuwee ligongo lya mundu jwammbone, nambo itendakomboleka mundu kujiga kuwee ligongo lya mundu jwaatenda hikubho yammbone. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Nambo Annoongo atekulangia upalyo gwabhe kwaachitu kubhee, patukibha na mabohu, Akilisito akawee ligongo litu. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Nangocheni tutekondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo kwa ndela ja mayahi ja Akilisito, jilangia pandaa kweli kubhee apakutuokoa mu lilaka lya Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Patukibha tangu akaapwati bha Annoongo, Annoongo akatutenda tukamulane mabhoko na jono kwa malilo ga mwana jwabhe, na patupakujomola kukamulana mabhoko na jono apakutuokoa kwa ndela ja umomi gwabhe. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Pamo na genago, tutenda kuhangalala kwa Annoongo kupetela Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito yakubhee atutendite tukamulane mabhoko na Annoongo.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aadamu na Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Henela, kupetela mundu jumo bhandu bhoa bhatendakubhelekwa na mabohu na kwa mabohu genago bhandu bhatendakujomokanga. Kujomoka kutekwaahikila bhandu bhoa, kwa kubhee bhoa bhatenditinge mabohu. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Tangu ja kuhika Malagilo ga Amusa pachilambo, mabohu gakibha pachilambo. Nambo handa gakwa Malagilo, mabohu gangamanyikana handa mabohu. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Hata henela, tangu machobha ga Aadamu mpaka machobha ga Amusa, kujomoka kukibha kwa bhandu bhoa hata kwa bhenibhala bhangatendanga mabohu handa henela Aadamu pabhakaabhelua Annoongo, yakubhee akibha atekulandana na jonijola jwapakuhika. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Nambo kulemwa kwa Aadamu ngakomboleka kulandana na ngwahupa ja Annoongo. Handa ikibha kulemwa kwa jonijola mundu jumo bhajingi bhakajomokanga, kupunda muno umbone gwa Annoongo, na uwecho gugubhii mu umbone gwabhe Ayesu Kilisito gutekupunda ligongo lya bhenibhala bhajingi. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kutekubhee na kulekanilana pakati ja ngwahupa ja Annoongo ngalandana na mabohu ga mundu jola jumo. Kwa kubhee pabhakalemwa mundu jumo, Annoongo akaahukumula, nambo pabhakalemwanga bhandu bhajingi, Annoongo akaapekeanga ngwahupa jabhe kwa kwatenda bhakondekwange. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Kweli, kwa mabohu ga mundu jumo, bhandu bhakajemeka kujomoka ligongo lya jonijola mundu jumo, nambo, nga kweli kubhee chibhakachitenda jonijola mundu jumo, yakubhee nga Ayesu Kilisito, nga chammbone muno. Bhoa bhapokelanga umbone gonogwe na ngwahupa jenejo ja kondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo, bhapakutawalanga mu umomi kwa ndela ja jono jumo, Ayesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Henela, handa kulemwa kwa mundu jumo kukaleta kuhumulwa kwa bhandu bhoa, hela hela chikubho chammbone chibhatendite mundu jumo chitekwaatendanga bhandu bhoa bhakondekwange nnoongi ja Annoongo na kutupekea ngwahupa ja umomi. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Kuleka kujeketela kwa mundu jumo bhandu bhajingi bhakabhonekena kubhee bhakolite mabohu, hela hela kujeketela kwa mundu jumo kupakwaatenda bhajingi bhakondekwange nnoongi ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Malagilo ga Amusa pagakaletwa gakajambukia kujonjokeka mabohu. Nambo mabohu pagakajonjokeka, umbone gwa Annoongo gukajonjokeka muno. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Handa henela mabohu pagakibha na machili kwajambukianga bhandu kujomoka, hela hela na umbone gwa Annoongo gutendakwatendenga bhandu bhakondekwange nnoongi ja Annoongo na kwaletelanga umomi gwa machobha goha gangapela kwa ndela ja Ayesu Kilisito Hangwana bhitu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Kujomoka mu mabohu na kubhee bhamomi mu Akilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Tulobhole chiniki nangocheni? Bholi, tupunde kutame mu kutendanga mabohu ili umbone gwa Annoongo gujonjokeke? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Hopo hata kachoko! Tweenga yakubhee ngatabhaliwa kabhele na mabohu, tukombolabholi kutama kabhele mu kupangana mabohu? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Ngahimanyanga kubhee twenga twabhoa tutekubatichwa mu Akilisito Ayesu, tukabatichwanga na kulondanika na kujomoka kwabhe. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Patukabatichwa tukalondanika na kujomoka kwabhe, tukachikwa pamo na bhenabho, ili handa henela Akilisito pabhakayokekwa kwa machili ga ukolo gwa Atati, twenga kabhele tukombole kutama mu umomi guyono. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Handa tutekulondanika na jonojwe mu malilo gabhe, hela hela tupakulondanika na jonojwe kwa kuyoka kwabhe. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Tuhimanyi kubhee umundu gwitu gwa lolo gukajomoka na kubhambwa panchalaba pamo na Akilisito, ili machili ga mabohu gakotokututawala, na twenga tukotokubhee kabhele akaabhanda bha mabohu. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Mundu handa ajomwike kwa namuna jenejo abhekitwe kutali na mabohu. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Bahi, handa tutekujomoka pamo na Akilisito, tutenda kuhobhalela kubhee tupakutama kabhele pamo na jonojwe, <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />kwa kubhee tuhimanyi kubhee Akilisito atekuyoka na ngajomoka kabhele, malilo ngabhee kabhele na mamulaka nnani jabhe. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Akilisito akajomoka gunakamo tu, akagapeta machili ga mabohu, na kutama kwabhe atendakwabhajila Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Mwangota hela hela, mwangota mpalikwa nchibhonange kubhee ntekujomoka kwa ngani ja mabohu, nambo nchibhonange bhandu bhantamanga pamo na Annoongo kwa kwahobhalela Ayesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Bahi, mabohu gakotokuntawalanga kabhele mu mimele jinunji jijijomoka, na nkotokoonda mabohu gahumukumule mimele jinunji. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Wala nkotokubhoanga hata yeega jimo ja mimele jinunji kubhee handa chilebhe cha kutendelanga mabohu. Nambo mpalikwanga nchibhoange mwakaachina bhene kwa Annoongo handa bhandu bhabhayokite, nchibhoange mwakaachinabhene ligongo lya kutenda gagabhajilwa na Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Mabohu ngantawalanga kabhele kwa kubhee mwangota ngalongolelwanga na Malagilo kabhele nambo ntenda kulongolelwanga na umbone gwa Annoongo.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaabhanda bha kutenda gabhagapala Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Bahi, tulobhole niki? Tutendange mabohu kwa kubhee nangocheni tubhihopo pahi ja Malagilo au pahi ja umbone gwa Annoongo? Hikombolekahopo! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Bholi, muhimanyitinge kubhee panchibhoanga kwa mundu joajola handa akaabhanda na kwakonda mundu, mpakubhee kweli akaabhanda bha mundu jonojwe, handa nchibhohitinge mwakaachinabhene kubhee akaabhanda bha mabohu kupela kwabhe nga kujomoka au handa nchibhohitinge mwakaachinabhene kwa kwakonda Annoongo mpakondekwa nnoongi jabhe. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Nambo tutendakwaachukulu Annoongo, hata handa mwangota mwakibhanga akaabhanda bha mabohu lolo, nangocheni ntekondanga kwa mitima jinunji joha kwa genigala majigano gampokilinge, <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />na pankabhekwa kutali na mabohu, ntekubhee akaabhanda bha kutenda hilebhe hibhaipala Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Ndekulongela na mwangota kwa kulandanikia na abhanda, ili nkombolange kuelewanga chindendakulongela, lolo nkibhanga akaabhanda bha mabohu kwa kuchibhoa mwakaachinabhene kubhee yoombo ya kutenda gabohu, na mabohu ginunji gakajonjokeka muno, nambo nangocheni mpalikwa nchibhoange kwa Annoongo mu umomi gwinunji gwoa, mmangange akaabhanda bha hikubho hiiyabhajila Annoongo ili nkombolange kujelejekwa na Annoongo mwene.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Pankibhanga akaabhanda bha mabohu, na wala mwangaganikianga kutenda hikubho hiyaabhajila Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Nambo mpatitinge chiniki machobha gala kubhokana na hikubho yela yakubhee nangocheni muhibhonelanga honi? Kupela kwa hikubho heyo nga kujomoka. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Nambo nangocheni kwa kubhee ntekulekelwanga kubhoka mu ubhanda gwa mabohu nangocheni mmilinge akaatumichi bha Annoongo na ntekubhee bhandu bhabhe na kupela kwa yoa nga kupata umomi gwa machobha goha gangali kupela. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Handa mpakutumikila mabohu muhimanye kubhee mpakujimoka, nambo handa mpakubhee bha Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito, Annoongo apakumpekeanga ngwahupa ja umomi gwa machobha goha gwangapela mu kulondanika na Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Kulandana na ulombela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Akaalongo bhangu, panga lipamba mpakugamanyanga gangani gandenda kulongela, maana ndenda kulongolea na bhandu bhabhagamanyanga Malagilo ga Amusa. Malagilo gabhii na machili penipala mundu pabhabhee jwamomi. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Kwa kulandanikia, mwikege jwaatekulombwa atenda kutabhwa na Malagilo machobha goha hangwana bhabhe pabhabhee jwamomi, nambo hangwana bhabhe pabhapakujomoka, gena Malagilo ngabhee na machili kabhele kwa jono mwikege. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Henela bahi, handa jono mwikege apakulombwa na mwanalome jongi kongo hangwana bhabhe abhi tangu jwamomi, apakemwa alolohi. Nambo hangwana bhabhe handa ajomwike, jono mwikege ngatabhwa kabhele na Malagilo ga ulombela, na handa apakulombwa na mundu jongi ngakemwa alolohi. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Kwa ndela jojojo mwangota akaalongo bhangu, kabhele nkabhekwanga kutali na Malagilo na umundu gwinu gwa lolo pagukibha handa gutekujomoka pamo na Akilisito. Nangocheni mwangota nga bhabhe joni jola jwaayokite, twabhoa nga bhakwe ili tupangane hikubho yammbone ya kwaabhajila Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Patukibha tutenda kutama handa chibhatamanga bhandu, kulikola kubohu kukajambukiwa na Malagilo kukatenda lihengo mu mmele jitu, na tukatenda hikubho hiitupeleka kujomoka. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Pena lolo tukatabhwa na Malagilo, nambo nangocheni tutekujomoka pamo na Akilisito, na henela tutekujogolekwa kubhoka mu Malagilo. Nangocheni ngantumikila Annoongo kwa ndela ja lolo ja kukamula Malagilo gagajandwike, nambo tutendakwaatumikila Annoongo kwa ndela jiyono ja kutandaikwa na Mboomo jabhe.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilo na mabohu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Bholi, ngocheni tulobhole chiniki, tulobholole Malagilo nga mabohu? Ngabha hopo! Nambo, panga Malagilo, nenga ngamanyitehopo mabohu nga chilebhe niki, kwa kubhee ngamanyitehopo kulokolila nga chilebhe niki handa Malagilo gakalobwilehopo, “Nkotokulokolila.” <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Nambo pangahimanya Malagilo haga, kulikolila kubohu kukejemeka kujimua nkati jangu, kwa kubhee panga Malagilo mabohu gangali machili. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Tangu nangagamanya Malagilo ndenditakutama handa chimbala, nambo panakagamanya Malagilo chigapala, nakamanya kubhee nenga nkola mabohu. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Nakagabhona genigala Malagilo gagaleta umomi, na Malagilo gatekunnetela hukumulo ja kujomoka. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Henela, mabohu gakandemba kwa ndela ja jene amuli na kunnetela hukumulo ja kujomoka.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Henela jilangia kubhee Malagilo gabhokite kwa Anoongo mwene. Malagilo genago nga gammbone kabhele gabhile handa chiipalikwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Bholi, chenichela chichibhii chammbone chitekunnetela hukumulo ja malilo? Hopo! Nambo ili mabohu gamanyike kubhee mabohu, gakaleta hukumulo ja kujomoka kupetela chenichela chichibhii chammbone, ili kwa ndela ja amuli, mabohu gakabhonekana pandaa kubhee gangali mmbone muno.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupwatilana nkati ja mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Tuhimanyi kubhee Malagilo nga hikubho ya chimboomo, nambo nenga nga mundu jika nakibha ndekuuchwa ku ubhanda bha mabohu. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Ngachimanya chinichitenda, kwa kubhee lyenilyela linilipala kutenda, ngalitenda, nambo chindendakuchichimwa nga chinichitenda. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Bahi handa ndenda kutenda lyenilyela nangalipala kutenda, nga kubhee ndendakoonda kubhee Malagilo nga gammbone. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Nambo, ngabha nenga nilitenda lyenilyela nangalipala ila nga genigala gabohu gagatama nkati jangu nga gaganyambukia nenga kupangana genago. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Niimanyi yakubhee nkati jangu, ngatama lilobhe lilibhii lyammbone, kwa kubhee hata ndendakupala kupangana chikubho chammbone, nambo ngakombola kulitenda. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Lyenilyela lyammbone linilipala, ngalitenda, ila lyenilyela libohu lyanangalipala nga ndenda kupangana. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Bahi handa ndenda kupangana lyenilyela nangalipala kupangana, ngabha nenga kabhele jumbangana henela, ila nga genigala mabohu gagatama nkati jangu.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Bahi, ndekumanya penipala pambala kupangana chikubho chammbone, chikubho chichibhii chibohu nga chindenda kuagula. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Malagilo ga Annoongo ndendakugapala kwa ntima gwangu goa. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Nambo ndekumanya kubhee nkati jangu kubhii na Malagilo gangi gagapwatilana na kuganikia kwangu kwammbone, Malagilo genago gandenda nenga kubhee abhanda bha mabohu mu mmele gwangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Chikubho chenecho chinyambukia nenga kuhechuka muno! Nga aganiki jwambakulamia kubhokana na gongo mmele gwa malilo? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Ndendakwaachukulu Annoongo kwa ndela ja Ayesu Kilisito, Hangwana bhitu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Henela nga chimile, nenga namwene kwa luunda lwangu, ndendakutumikila Malagilo ga Annoongo, nambo kwa umundu gwangu ndendakuhuutwa kupangana mabohu.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Kutama kwa machili ga Mboomo ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Henela, nangocheni Annoongo ngahukumulanga bhandu bhenibhala yakubhee mu umomi gwabhenji bhatekulondanika kupetela Kilisito Ayesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Kwa kubhee Malagilo ga Mboomo ja Annoongo gagaleta umomi mu kulondekana na Akilisito Yesu tekunekelela kubhoka mu Malagilo ga mabohu gagaleta malilo. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Annoongo atekutenda chenichela chikubho chakubhee Malagilo ga Amusa gangakombola kupangana, ligongo lya umundu gwitu gwangali machili, Annoongo akaatuma Mwana jwabhe kongo abhi na mmele handa twenga chitubhile ili kwa mmele gwabhe gonogwe atekubhee chadaka ja kutubhokea mabohu gitu, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Annoongo akapangana henela ili tukombole kupangana genigala gagalagikwa na Malagilo, kwa kujihobhalela Mboomo jwa Annoongo nambo kwa kulupalila mimele jitu. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Maana bhenibhala bhabhatamanga kwa kuhikagulanga hikubho ya mmele bhatendakuganikianga hikubho ya mmele, ila bhenibhala bhabhahikagula Mboomo bhatendakuganikianga hikubho ya Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Kuganikia kukutandaikwa na mmele kuleta malilo, ila kuganikia kukutandaikwa na Mboomo kuleta umomi gwa machobha goa na kutongamanika. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Konikola kutandaikwa na kuganikia chimmele kutenda kupwatilana na Annoongo, na kwa kubhee kuganikia konokwe ngajeketela Malagilo ga Annoongo, wala ngakombola kujeketela. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakagula hikubho ya mmele gwa mabohu, ngakombolanga kwaabhajila Annoongo.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Nambo mwangota ngatama kwa kugakagula gagapalikwa na mmele, nambo kujaulilana na gagapalikwa na Mboomo, tutendakutandaikwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo tu atama nkati jinunji. Henela mundu joajola jwabhiiopo na Mboomo ja Akilisito, jonojwe ngabha jwa Akilisito. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Nambo handa Akilisito abhii nkati jinu, henela hata handa mimele jinu jibhii handa jijaula kukuwee ligongo lya mabohu, nambo Mboomo ja Anoongo nga umomi ligongo lya kondekwa na Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Handa Mboomo ja Annoongo jwaatekwaayoha Ayesu, atama nkati jinunji, jonojwe jwaatekwaayoha Akilisito Ayesu apakuipekea umomi mimele jinunji jijijaula kukukuwee, apakutenda henela kwa ndela ja Mboomo jabhe jwaatama nkati jinunji.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Henela bahi, akaalongo bhangu, tukweti na lihengo, ngapalikwa kutama kagulana handa mimele jitu chiipala. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Kwa kubhee handa mpakutama kutenda handa mimele jinunji chiipala, kweli mpakujomokanga, nambo handa mpakulekanga hikubho hibohu ya mmele kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo, penapo mpakulamanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Bhandu bhoa bhabhalongolelwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo bhenabho nga bhana bha Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Mwangampokela Mboomo ja Annoongo jwaantendanga mwangota akaabhanda kabhele na kunnekelelanga lipamba, nambo ntekumpokelanga Mboomo jwaantenditinge mwangota bhana bha Annoongo, na kwa Mboomo jonojwe, twenga twaakema Annoongo, “Aba, nga kulobhola, Atati.” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Mboomo mweene atendakongoloka pamo na mboomo yitu kubhee twenga nga bhana bha Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Bahi, kwa henela twenga nga bhaana bha Annoongo, tupakupokela Annoongo apakutupekea gammbone bhandu bhabhe bhoa, na tupakupokela hikubho heyo kubhoka kwa Annoongo pamo na Akilisito, kweli handa tupakulaga pamo na jonojwe Akilisito, tupakupata ukolo gwabhe.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukolo guguhika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Henela, ndendakuibhona heye hibhini ya nangocheni kubhee ngabha chilebhe, handa gonigola ukolo gwa Annoongo gugupakuhunukulikwa kwaachitu. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Hiyuumbe yoa hitenda kulendela kwa kulokolila muno kupala kulola kuhunukulilwa kwa bhana bha Annoongo, <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />kwa kubhee hiyuumbe yoa hibhekitwe mu kupoganikwa, ngabha handa chiikapalanga yeene, ila hikatendekwa henela handa chibhakapala Annoongo. Hata henela gabhile gakulupalila, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />kwa kubhee hiyuumbe yeene yoa hipakuokolewa kubhoka mu ubhanda bha ubohu na kupekewa ukolo gwa bhana bha Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Tuhimanyi kubhee mpaka nangocheni, hiyuumbe yoa hitendakubhobhola kwa hibhini handa ga kuchijogola mwana. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Ngabha hiyuumbe jika jabhe hata na twenga twaachinabhene tutubhii na bhena Mboomo ja Annoongo, jwaabhile ngwahupa ja kujemeka ja Annoongo, na twenga kabhele tutendakubhobhola mu mitima jitu, kongo tubhikulendelela tupanganwe bhana bha Annnoongo, na mimele jitu jikombolewe. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Kwa kulupalila genago twenga tukombolilwe. Nambo kulupalila konokwe kwanga maana handa tutenda kulola chenichela chitutendakulupalila. Henela nga aganiki jwaakulupalila chenichela chibhachibhona? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Handa tutendakulupalila kupata chenichela yakubhee twangachibhona tangu, tutenda kuchilendelela kwa kuimbilila.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Hiyoyo, hata handa tweenga tutekupongokewa na machili nambo Mboomo ja Annoongo atendakutujongekea machili penipala patupongokewa na machili kwa kubhee twangahimanya kujopa handa chiipalikwa. Nambo Mboomo mweene atenda kutujopela kwa Annoongo kwa lilobhe lya kiha lyangalobholeka. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Annoongo jwaalola mpaka nkati ja mitima ja bhandu, atenda kugamanya gabhaganikia jono Mboomo, kwa kubhee jono Mboomo atenda kwaajopela bhandu bha Annoongo kagulana handa henela chibhapala.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Twenga tutenda kuhimanya yakubhee mu hikubho yoa Annoongo apangana lihengo pamo na bhoa bhabhaapala, mu kwaapekeanga gammbone, nga bhenibhala bhabhatekemwa ligongo lya lihengo lyabhe. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Bhenibhala Annoongo bhabhatekwahagula kubhokela kandahi, kabhele jwaatekwabhekanga bhapatange kulandana na Mwana jwabhe, ili abhee abhelehi bha kujemeka pakati ja akaalongo bhajingi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Bhenibhala bhabhakahagulikwa na Annoongo nga bhenabho bhabhatekwamekanga, na bhenibhala bhabhakemite nga bhenabho bhabhakakoondekwa nnoongi jabhe na bhenabho bhakaakonda nnoongi jabhe nga bhenabho bhabhapakutama nabho machobha goa.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upaliho gwa Annoongo mu Akilisito Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Bahi, tulobhole niki kwa ngani ja gangani? Handa Annoongo akibha upande gwitu, nga aganiki jwaapakombola kutukana? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Handa Annoongo jwangaabhilila Mwana jwabhe jwa jika, ila akaabhoa ligongo litu twenga twabhoa. Handa atendite henela, bholi, ngatupekea gammbone goha? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Nga aganiki jwaapakwatakia bhenibhala bhandu bhabhahagulikwe na Annoongo? Annoongo mwene nga jwabhakondanga kubhee bhammbone. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Aganiki jwaapakunhukumulanga kubhee tulemwite? Jwakwa! Kwa kubhee Akilisito nga jwaajomwike, kabhele akayoka, na jonojwe abhii upande gwa mamulaka kwa Annoongo, kabhele nga jwaatenda kutujopela. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Aganiki jwaakombola kutulekania na upaliho gwa Akilisito? Bholi, nga kulaga, au nga hibhini au njala, uwocho gwa ngobho, au kupotekwa, au kujomoka? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Handa chiijaandikwe mu Majandiko ga Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Ligongo linu, malilo gatendakutulolea muhi na kilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">tutenda kupanganwa handa ngondolo jwa kuchenjwa.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Nambo, mu hikubho heye yoa, tutendakujangatilwa na Ayesu jwaatupalite. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ndekuhimanya kweli kubhee chakwa chilebhe chichipakombola kutulekania na upaliho gwa Annoongo, ngabha malilo wala umomi, na ngabha akaatumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo, na ngabha machili gangi ga kunani kwa Annoongo, na ngabha gagabhokela nangocheni, na ngabha gagapakubhokela nnoongi, na ngabha bhabhakweti mamulaka, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />ngabha gagabhile nnani, na ngabha gagabhile pahi, na ngabha chiumbe chengi choachela ngakombola kulekana na upaliho gwa Annoongo gugubhii mu Kilisito Ayesu Hangwana bhitu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Annoongo na bhandu bhabhe Bhaisalaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ndenda kulobhola kweli mu Kilisito Ayesu, wala ngalongela unami, Mboomo ja Annoongo atendakulangia mu ntima gwangu kubhee ndendakutandaikwa na Mboomo jabhe, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />nambo ntima gwangu gutendakumina muno kwa hibhini yangajomoka. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Ngambola kulokolila hata nenga kulaaniwa na kubhekwa kutali na Akilisito ligongo lya akaalongo bhangu kwa mmele, <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />nga bhandu bha ku Isilaeli yakubhee Annoongo atekwaagula bhabhee bhana bhabhe, atekwahunukulila gonigola ukolo gwa Annoongo, gonigala gubhakalagananabho, na bhabhakaapekea Malagilo gabhe, na bhabhakaajigana namuna ja kwajopa na hilebhe hijingi hibhakaalobholela kubhee apakwapekea. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Bhena Bhaisailaeli nga ubhelehi gwa hiyokolo, yakubhee kubhoka kwabhenji Kilisito akahika handa mundu, jonojwe yakubhee nga Annoongo jwaabhii panani ja yoha, jwaalumbalilwa machobha goha pangapela! Na hibhee henala.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Ngalongela kubhee Annoongo atekulepela kwapekeanga genigala gaatekwalobholelanga kubhee apakwapekeanga, kwa kubhee ngabha bhandu bhoa bha ku Isilaeli nga bhabhatekuagulikwa na Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Ngabha hibhelei yoa ya Aaibulahimu nga bhana bhabhe bha kweli. Nambo, handa chigalobhola Majandiko ga Annoongo, “Hibhelei yakwe ipakubhokana na Aisaka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Jenje jilangia kubhee, ngabha bhenibhala bhabhabhelekwa handa bhandu bhangi chibhabhelekwa, ila nga bhana bhabhabhelikwe handa henela Annoongo chibhalongile. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Nambo chenichela chibhalongile Annoongo nga chenjeni, “Mbakubhuja kabhele machobha handa gangani manicha, na Asala apakubheleka mwana mwanalome.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Ngabha henela jika, hela hela Alebeka na jono apakubheleka mabhela kwa atati jumo, nga atati bhitu Aisaka. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Nambo, ili Annoongo abhonekane kubhee abhii na ukolo gwa kuagula, hata tangu bhenibhala bhana bhangabhelekwa na kombola kulimanya lyammbone na libohu, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Alebeka akalobholelwa kubhee jonijola mwana kwa kujemeka apakuntumikila jonijola nchoko. Henela kuagula kwa Annoongo kukagulana handa chibhakema mwene, na ngabha hikubho ya mundu. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Handa Majandiko ga Annoongo chigalobhola, “Ndekubhajilwa na Ayakobo, nambo Aesau nakaachimwa.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Bahi, tulobhole chiniki? Bholi, Annoongo ngatenda chiipalikwa? Hopo! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Annoongo akaalobholela Amusa, “Mbakwabhonela kiha mundu joajola jumbala kwabhonela kiha, mbakwalolea kiha joajola junaapalite.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Henela, genago goa kulupalila kiha ja Annoongo, ila ngabha chibhapala mundu. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Majandiko ga Annoongo galobhola henela kwa ngani ja Afalao, “Nakantenda amwenye ili kupetela mwenga, naangie machili gangu, na lina lyangu litangachwe pachilambo poha.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Bahi, handa nga henela, Annoongo atendakwabhonela kiha mundu joajola jwaapala kwaabhonela kiha, kabhele handa apaalite kuntenda mundu abhee mitahu atenda henela.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaka lya Annoongo na kiha ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Komboleka upakungonya, “Handa nga henela, bahi kwa niki Annoongo atenda kutukokoleka? Nga aganiki jwaakombola kukana genigala gabhapala Annoongo?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Nambo, mwe mwamundu, mwe mwa aganiki hata mpala kwaakonya Annoongo? Bholi, chibhega chikombola kwaakonya jwaabhomba, “Kwaniki utekunhalakia henela?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Jwaabhomba hibhega akombola kugutumia undopi handa chibhapala na kubhomba hibhega hibhele kwa undopi golagola, chimo chibhee chakutopea na chengi chibhee changammbone.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Henele nga chiibhile kwa Anoongo. Akapala kulangia lilaka lyabhe na kulangia ukolo gwabhe. Bahi, akibha atendakulendela kwa kuimbilianga bhenibhala bhabhakapalikwa kongana na lilaka lyabhe bhenibhala bhandu bhabhakapalikwa komekwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Annoongo akapala kabhele kulangia kujimbika kwa ukolo gwabhe jwaakapala kutubhonela kiha, twenga jwaatekutubheka ili tubhee pamo na jonojwe mu ukolo gwabhe. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Twenga nga bhenabho jwaatekutukema, ngabha kubhoka pakati ja Bhayahudi tu ila kabhele kubhoka kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Handa henela Annoongo chibhalobhola mu chitabu cha alondohi bha Annoongo Ahosea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Bhenibhala bhabhakibhanga, ‘Ngabha bhandu bhangu,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">mbakwaakema, ‘Bhandu bhangu!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Na jonojwe, ‘Ngampala’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">mbakunkema, ‘Junampala!’<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Na penipala pabhalobholilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Mwangota ngabha bhandu bhangu’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">penapo bhapakemwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Bhana bha Annoongo bhabhabhii bhamomi.’”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Nabhena alondohi Aisaya akakwea lilobhe kwa ngani ja Bhaisilaeli, “Hata handa hibhelei ya ku Isilaeli nga hijingi handa nhanga gwa kumbwani, nga bhachoko jikajabhe bhabhapakuokolewa, <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />kwa kubhee Hangwana apakuchihukumula chilambo choa pangali kukabha.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Handa alondohi Aisaya pabhakalobhola pena kandahi, “Hangwana jwaabhile na uwecho goa handa akatuleekilehopo bhana bhangi bha ku Isilaeli, tukajomwike handa ku Sodoma, na tukajomwike handa ku Gomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakwaajopela bhandu bha ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Bahi tulobhole niki? Bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhangaloleanga kondekwa na Anoongo, nambo bhakombwile kondekwa kwa ndela ja kuhobhalela, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />kongo bhandu bha ku Isilaeli yakubhee bhakaloleanga kwa machili Malagilo ga kwaatenda bhakondekwe na Anoongo kupetela Malagilo, nambo bhangakondekwanga. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Kwaniki? Ligongo bhakakulupalila hikubho yabhenji na ngabha kuhobhalela. Bhandu bha ku Isiaeli bhabhilinge handa bhandu bhabhakobhanduka paliganga lyela lya kobhanduka. <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Handa chigalobhola Majandiko ga Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Ndendakubheka konokwe ku Sayuni liganga lya kobhanduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">mwala gugupakutenda bhandu bhagwee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">Nambo jwaapakwahobhalela ngabhona honi!”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Akaalongo bhangu, chimbala muno mu ntima gwangu, na kujopa kwangu kwa Annoongo nga ligongo lya Bhaisilaeli ajangu, bhaokolewange. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Kwa kubhee ngombola kulangia kupetela bhenaangota bhabhatenda kuchibhoanga muno kwaalolea Annoongo, nambo kuchibhoa konokwe ngabhokana na umanyo gwa kweli gwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Bhenaangota bhangahimanyanga henela bhandu chibhakondekwa na Annoongo. Bhandu bhatekujiga kujemeka ndela jabhenji akaachinabhene na henela bhaikondangahopo ndela jenejo jijaatendanga bhandu bhakondekwe na jonojwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Akilisito pabhakahika atekugatenda Malagilo gakotokubhee chilebhe cha kulupalilwa kwa kwaatenda bhandu bhakondekwe na Annoongo ila bhandu bhakondekwa na Annoongo kwa ndela ja kwaahobhalela Akilisito.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuokolewa nga ligongo lya bhandu bhoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Amusa atekujandika kwa ngani ja kondekwa na Annoongo jijibhokana na Malagilo kubhee, “Mundu joajola jwaapangana chiipalikwa na Malagilo apakutama kwa kukagula Malagilo genago.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Nambo kwa ngani ja kondekwa na Annoongo kwa ndela ja kuhobhalela, jitekujandikwa henela, “Nkotokulobholanga muntima gwinu, nga aganiki jwapakujenda mpaka kunani kwa Annoongo? Kulobhola henela nga handa kwaaleta Kilisito pahi, <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />au nga aganiki jwapakutuluka kujaula kwa bhabhawilinge?” Kulobhola henela nga handa kwaaleta Akilisito kubhoka kuchilambo cha bhabhawilinge. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Majandiko ga Annoongo gatendakulobhola henela, “Lyenilyela lilobhe lya Annoongo libhii kubhandikila na mwenga, libhile mu kang'wa na mu ntima gwinu.” Na konokwe nga konikola kuhobhalela kututenda kutangacha. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Handa mpakulobhola kwa malobhe ginu mweene kubhee Ayesu nga Hangwana na kuhobhalela muntima gwinu kubhee Annoongo akaayoha, mpakuokoka. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Kwa kubhee mundu jwatenda kuhobhalela kwa ntima gwabhe atendakondekwa na Annoongo na handa apakulobhola kwa kang'wa jakwe kubhee Ayesu nga akolo, mundu jonojwe apakuokolekwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Handa chigalobhola Majandiko ga Annoongo, “Kila jwaahobhalela Ayesu ngatendwa kubhee na honi.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ngani heje nga kwa bhandu bhoa, kwa kubhee kwaakwa kulengania pakati ja Bhayahudi na bhanga Bhayahudi, jonojwe nga Hangwana bha bhandu bhoa, jwabhii jwammbone kwa bhoa bhabhaajopa, <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />kwa kubhee Majandiko ga Annoongo galobhola, “Kila mundu jwapakwaakema Hangwana kwa kupala kujangatilwa, apakuokolewa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Nambo bhapakwaajopa bholi bhenabho kongo bhabhi ngaahobhalela? Kabhele bhapakombola bholi kwaahobhalela bhenabho bhangannyoanga? Bhapakwaajohanikia bholi panga kutangachiwa na bhandu? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Na bhandu bhapakutangacha bholi handa bhangalagilwanga? Handa chigalobhola Majandiko ga Annoongo, “Nga chikubho chammbone muno kuhika kwa bhenibhala bhandu bhabhatangachanga Ngani Jammbone!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Nambo ngabha bhandu bhoa bhabhapokile Ngani Jammbone. Jenje nga maana alondoi Aisaya alobhola, “Hangwana, nga aganiki jwahobhalile ngani jitu?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Henela bahi, kuhobhalela kujemekela kwa kujoanikia Ngani Jammbone, na jene ngani jitenda kubhokana na lilobhe lya Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Nambo ndendakukonya, bholi, bhangajijoha jene ngani? Kweli, bhakajijohanikia, handa Majandiko ga Annoongo chigalobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“Bhandu bhatekutangacha Ngani Jammbone pachilambo poha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">na bhandu bhatekujoanga Ngani Jammbone pachilambo poha.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Nanenga ndendakukonya kabhele, komboleka bhandu bha ku Isilaeli bhangahimanyanga? Kubhee Amusa bhene nga bhabhakajemeka kujangula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Mbakwaatenda mwabhonelange bwihu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">bhandu bhanga bha chilambo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">mbakuntendanga mmi na lilaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">bhandu bha chilambo cha bhandu bhabhangamanyanga chilebhe.” <verse eid="ROM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Kabhele alondohi Aisaya atendakulobhola panga bhoga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">“Bhenibhala bhandu bhanganolea bhatekumbata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">ndekuchilangia kwabhenji kwa bhabhangakonyekea nenga.” <verse eid="ROM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Nambo atenda kulobhola kwa ngani ja bhandu bha ku Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">“Muhi joha nakaapembeleanga bhandu bhangu bhakamulane mabhoko nanenga nambo bhakakananga kungagula bhenabho bhakibhanga mitau.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Annoongo atendakwaakolela kiha bhandu bha ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Bahi ndendakonya, bholi, Annoongo bhatekwaakananga bhandu bhakwe? Hopo! Nenga namwene nga mundu jwa ku Isilaeli, kabhele ubhelei gwa Aaibulahimu kubhoka likabila lya Abenjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Annoongo bhangakananga bhandu bhakwe, yakubhee bhenabho bhakaamanyanga kubhoka kandahi. Bholi, ngamanyaga genigala majandiko gagaakongolela alondohi Aelia? Henela chibhakaakokolekela Annoongo kwa ngani ja bhandu bha ku Isilaeli, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Aelia akalobhola, “Hangwana Annoongo, bhena bhandu bhatekwaakoma akaalondohi bhinu na kuibomolana pakubhokea mbeeko, nanenga ndekuhigalila jika jangu, na bhenaangota bhapalanga kungoma.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Nambo Annoongo akaalobholela, “Ndekuhigalilwa na bhandu elupu chaba bhabhangatindibhala majungwa kwaachalila Baali jwabhakaakema Annoongo.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Henela nga chiibhile nangocheni, bhabhile bhabhatekuagulikwa bhangi kwa umbone gwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Handa bhatekuhagulikwa kwa umbone gwa Annoongo, na ngabha kwa kulola hikubho yabhenji hibhatekuhitendanga. Handa Annoongo bhakaagulanga kwa kupetela hikubho ya bhandu hibhatekuhitendanga, penapo umbone gwabhe gukabhiihopo umbone kabhele. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Tulobhole chiniki nangocheni? Chenichela chilebhe chibhatekuchilolea bhandu bha chilambo cha ku Isilaeli bhangachipatanga, nambo bhabhatekuagulikwa bhakachipatanga na bhandu bhangi bhabhakahigalila bhakatendekwa bhakotokuelewanga ngani ja Annoongo, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />handa chijikaajandikwa mu Majandiko ga Annoongo, “Annoongo bhakabhatendanga handa bhandu bhabhatekugoloka, akabhapekea miho nambo bhakotokulola, na machikilo nambo bhakoto kujoanikianga mpaka leleni.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Kabhele Adaudi akalobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Lichobha lyabhenji likolongwa lya kulyee chakulya libhee ntambo gwa kwaatangilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">Bhagwelange na kupotekwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Macho gabhenji galekelelwe lubhendu ili gakoto kulola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">Ming'ongo jabhenji jipende kwa kulaga machobha goa.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Bahi, ndendakonya, Bholi, penipala Bhayahudi pabhakakobhanduka na kugwee, bholi ngakombolanga kujema kabhele? Hopo! Nambo ligongo lya kulemwa kwabhenji, kuokolewanga kutekwaahikilanga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, ili kwaatendanga Bhandu bha chilambo cha ku Isilaeli bhabhonange bwihu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Bahi, kwa kulemwa kwabhenji Bhayahudi kutekwaatendanga bhandu bha hilambo yengi bhapanganikiwe gammbone. Kabhele kwa kulemwa kwabhenji kwa ngani ya chimboomo kutekuleta kupanganikiwa hikubho hiijingi yammbone kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, bholi Bhanyahudi bhajingi handa bhapakwaabhujila Annoongo, bahi jitekulangia kubhee Bhayahudi bhajingi bhatekupanganikiwa gammbone gajingi.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuokolewa gwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Nangocheni ndendakulobhola na mwangota bhandu mwanga Bhayahudi. Kwa henela ndekubhee andundame kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, ndendakuchipunila lihengo lyangu, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />ili kwaatendanga Bhayahudi akaajangu bhabhabhonelange bwihu henela ngombole kubhaokoanga bhangi. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Handa kanikwa kwabhenji kukatenda bhandu bha pachilambo bhakamulane mabhoko na Annoongo, hipakubhee bholi pabhapakondekwa na Annoongo? Ipakubhee bholi penipala pabhapakoondekwa na Annoongo? Bhabhawilinge bhapakuyokanga!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Handa chipande cha kujemeka cha nkate chichibhokita kwa Annoongo, bahi nkate goha gupakubhee gwa Hangwana Annoongo, kabhele handa mikega ja mikongo jibhokita kwa Hangwana, na nyaambi jakwe jibhee nga ja Hangwana. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Penapo nyaambi yengi ya nkongo gwa nzeituni kubuchitani hikaheketwa, na maali pakwe nyaambi ja nzeituni gukapandikilwa. Mwangota bhandu bha hilambo yengi ntendakulandana na nyaambi lya nkongo gwa nzeituni gwa kumanyahi, na nangocheni ntendakutumia machili na malelalela ga nzeituni kubuchitani. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Bahi, nkotokwabhelua bhenibhala bhabhatekuheketwa handa nyaambi. Handa mpakwaabheluanga, nkombokelange kubhee ngabha mwangota mujijangatila mikega, nambo mikenga nga jitendakunnyangatilanga mwangota.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Bahi, mpakulobhola, “Nyaambi jela jikaheketwa ili nenga mbandikilwe mu gonogwe nkongo.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Bahi, jenjeni nga kweli nyaambi hikaheketwa ligongo lya kutokuhobhalela, ila mwenga nnyeme kwa kuhobhalela kwinu. Nambo nkotokuchipuna, ila nchilolekeange. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Handa Annoongo jwangaabhonela kiha Bhayahudi yakubhee nga bhakibhanga handa nyaambi kubhokela kandahi, bholi, ntendakuganikiha apakunkolela kiha mwenga? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Nnole, bahi Annoongo chibhabhile jwammbone na jwakalipa. Jonojwe nga jwammbone kwa bhenibhala bhandu bhabhatekugwee, na nga jwammbone kwaachinu handa mpakupunda mu kutenda gagabhi gammbone gakwe, handa ngabha henela na mwenga mpakuheketwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Bhenaangota Bhayahudi kabhele handa bhakalekanga kwanga kuhobhalela kwabhenji, bhapakupandikilwa kabhele mu nkongo, maana Annoongo akombola kunpandikianga kabhele mu gono nkongo. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Mwangota bhandu mwanga Bhayahudi, mwangota mmi handa nyaambi ya nkongo gwa mizeituni gwakumanyahi, nambo mmokikwe konokwe, bhakanpandikianga mu nzeituni kubuchitani chehemu yakubhee kubhokela lolo kwanga kwaachinunji. Nambo Bhayahudi bhalandana na nzeituni gwa kubuchitani, na hipakubhee nga kujojoka muno Annoongo kwaabhujianga mu nkongo gwabhenji bhene.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annoongo atendakwaabhonela kiha bhandu bhoa bha ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Akaalongo bhangu, mbala mugumanye ukweli gugutekuchiiya, kwa helye nkotokuchibhona mwa bhandu bhaluunda muno. Kulimba kwa mitima ja Bhayahudi gukibha nga gwa machobha kachoko tu, mpaka bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi pabhapakwahobhalela Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Henela nga bhandu bha ku Isilaeli chibhapakuokolewa, handa chiijandikwe mu Majandiko ga Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Akombohi apakuhika kubhoka ku chilambo cha Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">apakukubhoa ubohu gwabhenji kwa bhabhabhelikwe kwa Ayakobo.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Helyelye nga lilagano limbapakulitenda na bhenaangota</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">chimbapakugabhoa mabohu gabhenji.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Bhayahudi bhatendakujikananga Ngani Jammbone, bhatekubhee akaapwati bha Annoongo ligongo linu mwangota mwanga Bhayahudi. Nambo konikola kuhagulikwa na Annoongo, tangu nga akaaganja bhabhe ligongo lya akaanahota bhabhenji, <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />kwa kubhee Annoongo abhikwaapekea bhandu ngwahupa jabhe na kwaagula ngaakokoleka. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Pena lolo mwangota mwa bhandu mwanga Bhayahudi mwangaakonda Annoongo nambo nangocheni mpatite kiha jabhe ligongo lya kutokujeketela kwabhenji. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Helahela, bhena Bhayahudi bhatendakwaakana Annoongo nangocheni ili na bhenaangota bhapokelange kiha ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Annoongo atekwaatabha bhandu bhoa mu kulemwa kwabhenji ili abhabhonelange kiha bhoa.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Annoongo alumbalilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Eloo, Annoongo akweti hilebhe hijingi yakuhalala! Malango gabhe na umanyo gwabhe ngapela. Jwaakwa jwaakombola kongolela henela Annoongo chibhatendakuamua, na jwaakwa jwakombola kumanya henela Annoongo chibhatenda hikubho yabhe.<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Handa Majandiko ga Annoongo chigalobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">“Nga aganiki jwatekukumanya kuganikia kwa Hangwana?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Nga aganiki jwakombola kwajangatila Annoongo kuhukumula?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Au nga aganiki jwaampekie Annoongo chilebhe choachela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">ili abhujikiwe kabhele chilebhe hecho?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Hilebhe yoha hibhoka kwaachabhe, hiibhi kwa ukolo gwabhe na kabhele ligongo lyabhe, ukolo gwabhe gubhee machobha goha gangapela! Na hibhee henela.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Kutama kwa kwaatumikila Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Bahi, akaalongo bhangu, kwa kubhee Annoongo nga abhii na kiha hijingi, ndendakunnyopanga kwa ntima gwangu goha. Muchibhoange akaachinabhene kwa Annoongo mmangange handa mbeeko jijibhii jimomi, jijibhii ja Annoongo na jakwabhajila Anoongo. Jenje nga ndela jinunji ja kweli ja kwaachalila Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Nkotokuganikia handa bhandu bha heche chilambo chibhaganikianga, ila Annoongo agatendebhue genigala gang'anikianga. Ngapena pampakugumanyanga upaliho gwa Annoongo na kuchimanya chikubho hecho chichibhii chammbone, chichaabhajila na chichitekukamilika.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Ligongo lya umbone gwa Annoongo gubhatekumbekea ndendakunnobholelanga mwangota bhoha, nkotokuchibhona kubhee nga chilebhe chammbone kupunda chinpalikwa kubhee. Nchipemange mwakaachinabhene henela chimmilinge mu kuhobhalela yakubhee Annoongo akampekea kila jumo jwitu. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Handa henela mu mmele gumo gubhii na hiyega hijingi, na kila chiyega chimo chibhii na lihengo lyabhe. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Helahela na twenga tutubhii twaajingi tubhi mu mmele gumo kwa kulondanika na Akilisito, na kila jumo nga chiyega cha ajabhe. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Bahi, kwa kubhee tukwetii ngwahupa ya chimboomo hitutekupekewa kulongana na umbone gwa Annoongo. Handa mundu atendakutangacha lilobhe lya Annoongo na atangache kwa kuhobhalela kwabhe, <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />na jwaakombola kupanganga lihengo lya Annoongo na apangane lihengo lya Annoongo. Jwaakombola kujigana na ajigane. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Kabhele jwaakombola kwaalekelela ntima bhangi na atende henela. Jwaampekea ajabhe chibhabhi nacho na atende henela kwa upaliho. Ajemelei na ajemelele kwa kuchalila, na jwakutenda chikubho cha kiha na atende henela kwa kuhachuka.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Mpalanange panga undendemundu goha gola. Nkanange hikubho yoayela hibohu, kila jumo ammone nnyakwe jwammbone muno. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Mpalanange mwangota kwa mwangota handa akaajinunji bhabhalinge mu kuhobhalela, mwatopeange na kwalongoleanga bhangi. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Nkotokubhee akaakata, ila ntendange lihengo kwa ntima gwoa kongo mmi kwaatumikila Hangwana Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Kulupalila kwinunji kummekange mu kuhachuka machobha goa, mmangange bha kuimbililanga mu hibhini, na machobha goha ntamange mu kwaajopa Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Mwajangatilange akaajinunji bhabhahobhalela Akilisito handa mwangota mu hilebhe yabhenji, mwaamandikiange akaageni kwa upaliho.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Mwaatendelange gammbone bhoa bhabhatendakunnagianga, mwaatendelange gammbone wala nkotokwatendebhukia libhele. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Nhachukange pamo na bhoa bhabhatenda kuhachukanga, na ng'utange pamo na bhoa bhabhagutanga. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Ntamange kwa kuhengwa mwangota kwa mangota. Nkotokuchipunanga, nambo mmangange tayali kubhee aganja na bhandu bha kubhelulilwa na bhangi. Nkotokuchitendanga kubhee nkweti luunda kupunda bhangi bhoa.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Handa mundu atekunnemwa, nkotochibhujikia ubohu. Ntendange genigala gagamanyikana na bhandu kubhee gammbone. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Ntendange kila chinkombolanga ili nkombolange kutama kwa kuhengwa na bhandu bhoa. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Henela bhandu bhangu bhanampalanga, nkotokuchibhujikia mabohu nambo mwaalekelele Annoongo chikubho hecho, kwa kubhee Majandiko ga Annoongo, Hangwana alobhola, “Kwa ngani ja kuchibhujikia nga lihengo lyangu, nenga mbakummujikia.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Hela hela, Majandiko galobhola, “Apwati bhinu handa abhii na njala, mwapekee chakulya, handa abhii na nyota mwapekee machi ang'wee. Kwa kubhee handa mpakutenda henela mpakwaatenda abhee na honi ngolongwa.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Nkotokoonda ubohu gukupete, ila mwenga mugupete ubohu kwa kupangana gagabhii gammbone.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Kwajeketela akanachilongola bha chilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Kila mundu apalikwa kwajeketelanga akanachilongola bha chilambo, kwa kubhee jwakwa mundu jwakombola kutawala handa Annoongo jwangaaleka atawale, Annoongo jika jabhe nga jwaapekeanga bhandu bhabhatawala machili ga kutawala. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Henela jwagakana mamulaka ga akaachilongola atendakana lilagilo lya Annoongo, na bhenaangota bhabhatendanga henela bhapakuhumulwa. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Bhatawala ngaatichianga bhandu bhenibhala bhabhatendanga gammbone ila bhabhatenda mabohu. Bholi, mpala nkotokwaajogopa jwabhi na mamulaka? Bahi ntendange genigala gagabhiile gammbone na jonjo apakunnumbalila mwenga, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />kwa kubhee jonojwe nga antumichi jwa Annoongo jwaapangana mahengo ili kunnyatila mwenga. Nambo handa mpakupangana mabohu, mpalikwa kwaajogopa, kwa kubhee akolite uwecho gwa kunhukumula. Jonojwe nga antumichi jwa Annoongo, jwaalangia lilaka lyabhe kwa bhenibhala bhabhatenda mabohu. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Henela hipalikwa kwaajeketelanga bhabhabhilinge na ukolo, ngabha kwa kujogopa lilaka lya Annoongo lilipakuhika, ligongo ntendakumanyanga kubhee chenecho nga chammbone kupangana henela.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Kubhokana na genago mwangota ntendakulepanga kodi, kwa kubhee akaachilongola bhenabho bhaatumikila Annoongo pabhatenda lihengo lyabhenji. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Mumpekee kila mundu chibhapalikwa kupekewa. Handa ntendakulongwa kodi, nnepange kodi, handa nga uchulu, nnepange uchulu, jwapalikwa kujogopwa, mwaajogope, jwaapalikwa kutopewa, mwaatopee.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpalanange handa akaanung'una</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Nkotokulongwa na mundu joajola chilebhe choachela, ila tu nnongwange kupalananga. Kwa kubhee jwaampala nnyakwe, atekugajeketela Malagilo goga. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Malagilo gangani gagalobhola, “Nkotokutenda ngongola, nkotokukoma, nkotokujibha, nkotokulokolila na malagilo gangi goha,” gabhile mu lilagilo limo, “Mwaapale ajinu handa chinchipala mwabhene.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Jwampala nnyakwe ngaatendela gabohu. Bahi, kupalana nga kujeketela Malagilo goha. <verse eid="ROM 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Bahi, mwangota ntendange henela, kwa kubhee mmanyanga muda gwa kujimuka kubhoka mulugono gutekuhika, na nangocheni kuokolewa kwitu kutekubhandikila muno kupunda penipala kandahi patukajemeka kuhobhalela. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Kilo chipetite na kutekuchee. Tuhilekange hikubho yoha hibohu hitutendite mulubhendu, tutendange hikubho yammbone ya panhana. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Tutende kwa kutopea handa bhandu chibhatama muhi, na ngabha kwa kulyee muno na kukolelwa, ngabha kutenda ulolohi na kulepela kuchihibhila kulokolila hilebhe hibohu, ngabha kwa bulwa na bwihu. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Bahi, ng'anikiange na kupangana handa Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito, nnekange kukagula kulokolila kubohu kwa mimele jinunji.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Nkotokunhukumulanga bhangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Mummpokelange jonijola jwangabhee na machili mu kuhobhalela, nambo nkotokupwatilana na kutaukananga kwa ngani ja kuganikia kwabhe. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Mundu jumo kuhobhalela kwabhe kutendakwalekelea kulyee kila chilebhe, nambo mundu jongi jwangabhee na machili mu kohobhalela alyee tu likoolo. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Mundu jonojwe jwaalyee kila chilebhe akotokwaabhelua jonojwe jwangalyee. Jonojwe jwaalyee likoolo akotokwahukumula jonijola jwaalyee kila chilebhe, kwa kubhee Annoongo atekwakoonda. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Mwenga nga aganiki mpaka mwahukumule antumichi jwa jongi? Handa ajemite au handa agwile lenelyo nga lihengo lya akolo bhabhe, eloo, apakujema maha, kwa kubhee Hangwana Ayesu akombola kwajemea.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Mundu jongi atendakuganikia kubhee lichobha lyengi nga lyammbone kupunda lyengi, popopo jongi aganikia kubhee machobha goha gatekulandana. Bahi kila jumo abhee na ukweli kwa ngani ja genigala gabhaganikia. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Jonojwe jwaganikia kubhee lichobha lyengi nga lyammbone muno kupunda lichobha lyengi, atenda henela ligongo lya kwaatopea Annoongo, na jonojwe jwaaleyee chakulya choachela atenda henela ligongo lya Hangwana atendakwaachukulu Annoongo. Na jonijola jwaaleka kulyee chakulya choachela atenda henela ligongo lya Hangwana, na jonojwe atenda henela kwa kwaachukulu Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Jwakwa hata jumo jwitu jwaatama ligongo lyabhe mweene, wala jwakwa jwaajomoka ligongo lyabhe mweene. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Bahi, handa tutama, tutendakutama ligongo lya kwaabhajila Hangwana, na handa tutendakujomoka, tujomoka ligongo lya kwaabhajila Hangwana, henela handa kupakutama au tupakujomoka, tweenga nga bhandu bhabhe Hangwana. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Nga ligongo Akilisito akajomoka na kuyoka ili apate kubhee Hangwana bha bhandu bhoa, bhabhabhilinge bhamomi na bhabhatekujomoka. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Bahi, kwaniki mwenga ntendakwahukumula anung'una bhinu? Au kwaniki mwenga ntendakuwaabhelua anung'una jwinu? Kwa kubhee twenga twabhoa tupakujema nnongi ja chitengu chakuhumulila cha Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Majandiko ga Annoongo galobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">“Handa chindendakutama, alobhola Hangwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">kila mundu apakundindila majungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">na kila jumo apakulobhola kwa malobhe gabhe mweene kubhee nenga nga Annoongo.” <verse eid="ROM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Henela bahi kila jumo jwitu apakulongela ngani jabhe mweene nnoongi ja Annoongo.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkotokuntenda anung'una bhninu kulemwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Bahi, tuleke kwahukumulanga bhangi, nambo mmangange miho mundu akotokwaanyambukia jongi agwee mu mabohu. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Mu kulondanika na Hangwana Ayesu, ndendakuhimanyi kweli kubhee chaakwa chilebhe choachela chichipakundenda tukokondekwa kwa kwaachalila Annoongo, nambo handa mundu akaganikia kubhee chilebhe chengi chichitutenda twenga tukotokondekwa kwa kwaachalila, bahi, kwaachebhe twenga ngakondekwa kwaachalila. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Handa anung'una jwinu atenda kuhechuka ligongo lya chenichela chakulya chintenda kulyee, bahi hikubho yinu ngalongolelwa na Upaliho. Nkotokoonda hata kachoko chakulya chinu chibhee ligongo lya kuhobha kwa mundu jongi yakubhee Akilisito akajomoka ligongo lyabhe! <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Bahi, nkotokoonda chenichela chilebhe chimuchibhona kwaachinunji nga chammbone, bhandu bhangi bhakotokuchibhelua. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Umwenye gwa Annoongo ngabha kwa chilebhe cha kulyee na kung'wee, nambo kutama kwa kupangana genigala gagabhajila Annoongo kutama kuhengwa na kuhangalala kwa kulondanika na Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Mundu joajola jwaatumikila Akilisito kwa namuna jenjeni, atendakwabhajila Annoongo na kondekwa na bhandu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Henela na tuchimilange kugakamula genigala gagaleta kuhengwa na gagatujangatila kuchengana. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Bahi, nkotokuhalibiana lihengo lya Annoongo kwa mitau kwa ngani ja chakulya. Kwa kubhee yakulya yoha nga yammbone, nambo ngapalikwa kulyee chakulya chichipakuntenda mundu kulemwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Mbaya kuleka kulyee nduli, kung'wee divai, au kutenda choachela chichikombola kwaajambukia anung'una bhinu kulemwa kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Bholi, mwenga ntenda kuhobhalela? Konikola kuhobhalela kummi nako, mmee nako muntima gwinu na nnoongi ja Annoongo. Nga kuhangalala kupangana chenichela ching'anikia nga chammbone pangali kuchihukumula mwene. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Nambo mundu jwaabhile na lipamba na chakulya chibhalyee atekuhumulwa, kwa kubhee ngalyee kwa kuhobhalela. Choachela chibhapangana mundu pangali kuhobhalela chenecho nga chibohu.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Mwajangatilange bhangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Bahi, tweenga tutubhile tututekomala mu kuhobhalela tupalikwa kwaajangatila bhenibhala bhangakomala mu kuhobhalela. Tukotokuchilola twenga akaachinabhene tu. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Tupalikwa kwaajangatila bhangi kupangana hikubho yammbone, ili kwatendanga bhakolange mu kuhobhalela. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Hata Akilisito jwangachibhajila mweene, ila handa chijijaandikwe mu Majandiko ga Annoongo, “Kokoleka kubhatekunkokolekea mwenga kumbatite nenga.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Goha gagatekujandikwa mu Majandiko ga Annoongo, gatekujandikwa ligongo lya kutujigana tweenga ili kubhee kwa kulekelelwa ntima na kuhachukanga tutukupatite kubhoka mu Majandiko ga Annoongo ili tukombole kuhobhalela. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Annoongo mwene nga jwaatujangatila tubhee bhakuhimbalila na nga jwaatutenda mitima jitu jipole, henela ndendakunyopelanga ili Annoongo antendange kutama mu chibhoga chimo ligongo ntendakwakahgula Akilisito Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />ili mwangota mwabhoa, kwa pamo na kwa lilobhe limo, mwaalumbalile Annoongo na Atati bha Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngani Jammbone kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Bahi, mpokelanange mwangota kwa mwangota, handa Akilisito chibhampokelanga mwangota ili kwaaletela Annoongo ukolo. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Ndendakunnobholelanga, Akilisito akaatumikilanga Bhayahudi ili kulangia ukweli gwa Annoongo, na genigala gabhakalobhola Annoongo kubhee apakwapekeanga akanahota bhitu gapate kweela, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />kabhele ili bhena bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhakombolange kwaalumbalila Annoongo ligongo lya kiha jabhe. Handa chigalobhola Majandiko ga Annoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Henela mbakunnumbalila mwenga pakati ja bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">Mbakujemba mijembo ja kunnumbalila.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Kabhele Majandiko ga Annoongo galobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">“Nhachukange mwa bhandu mwanga Bhayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">nhachukange pamo na bhandu bhabhe.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Kabhele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">“Mwangota bhandu mwanga Bhayagudi, mwalumbalile Hangwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">mwe bhandu bhoa, mwaalumbalile Hangwana!”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Kabhele alondohi Aisaya alobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">“Apakupitila mundu mu chibhelei cha Ayese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">jonojwe apakwatawala bhandu bha hilambo yoa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhapakwakulupalila kubhee jonojwe apakwahokoanga.” <verse eid="ROM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Annoongo nga jwaakulupalilwa, ampekeange kuhachuka kujingi na kuhengwa kubhokana na kuhobhalela kwinu, ili kulupalila kwinunji kukombole kujonjokeka kwa machili ga Mboomo ja Annoongo.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengo lya Apaulo kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Akaalongo bhangu, nenga namwene ndendakuhobhalela kubhee mpangananga hikubho hijingi yammbone, na mmilinge na umanyo nnyingi, kabhele nkombolanga kujigananga mwakaachinabhene. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Nambo ndekunyandikilanga kwa ngani ja hikubho hijingi pangali bhoga, ili konkombokeanga kwa ngani ja umbone gwa Anoongo gubhatekumbekea, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />gwa kubhee antumichi bha Ayesu Kilisito kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. Lihengo lyangu lya chikung'i kujitangacha Ngani Jammbone ja Annoongo ili bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhakombolange kubhee mbeeko jikondekwa na Annoongo, mbeeko ligongo lya Annoongo bhabhatekuhagulikwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Henela mu kulondanika na Ayesu Kilisito, ngombola kuchipunila lihengo lyangu ligongo lya Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Ngapalikwa kulobhola chilebhe choachela kupunda chenichela yakubhee Akilisito achitendite kwa kunagia nenga ili bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhakombolange kwaakonda Annoongo. Bhatekutenda henela kwa malobhe na hikubho, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />kwa machili ga kupangana hilolelo na yakangachika, na kwa ukolo gwa Mboomo jwa Annoongo. Bahi, kwa kujaula koha koha, kubhoka konikola ku Yelusalemu mpaka kuchilambo cha Iluliko, ndekutangacha maha Ngani Jammbone ja Akilisito. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Lihengo lyangu litekubhee kujitangacha Ngani Jammbone penipala yakubhee bhandu bhangakombolanga kujoanikia kwa ngani ja Akilisito, mbangana henela ili ngoto kubhujila kujemeka lihengo penipala yakubhee mundu jongi atekupangana. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Nambo handa Majandiko chigatekujandikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">“Bhandu bhoa bhabhangalobholelwanga ngani jabhe bhapakulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">na bhenibhala bhabhangakombolanga kujoa bhapakumanyanga.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakupanga kutyangila kuchilambo cha Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Kubhokela na genago mala hijingi nikakanikiwa kuhika kwaachinunji. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Nambo nangocheni ndekujomola lihengo lyangu mu hilambo heye ngocheni mbala kuhika kwaachinunji handa chiindekulokolila kwa yaaka hijingi, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />ndendakulupalila kuntyangilanga mwangota penipala pambakubhee mu ulendo kujaula ku Hisipania. Na mbakubhee na mwangota kwa muda nchoko. Mbakuhachukanga na mwangota, penapo mbakujangatilwa na mwangota mu ulendo gonogwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Nambo nangocheni, ndenda kujaula kupangana lihengo lya Annoongo kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bha konokwe ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Kwa kubhee malubhalo ga bhandu gagaahobhalela Akilisito bha chilambo cha ku Makedonia na ku Akaya, gatekuamua kubhoa nchango gwabhenji kwaajangatila bhandu bha Annoongo bhabhabhile akaahocho, konokwe ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Bhenaangota bhatekuamua kutenda henela, nambo kwa kweli, lyenelyo nga lihengo lyabhenji ligongo lya bhena bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, kwa maana, handa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhatekupatanga gammbone ga Bhayahudi, bhapalikwa kabhele kwaatumikilanga Bhayahudi mu hilebhe ya pammele hibhaipalanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Pambakujomola kutenda lihengo helyo na kwaapekeanga nchango gonogwe gugutekukumbwa ligongo lyabhenji, mbakuntyangilanga mwangota pambakubhee nndela kujaula kuchilambo cha ku Hisipania. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Ndenda kuhimanya yakubhee handa mbakuhika kwaachinu Akilisito apakuntendelanga hikubho hijingi yammbone.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Bahi, akaalongo bhangu, ndendakunnyopanga kwa lina lya Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito na kwa upaliho guguletwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo, nchilondanikange na nenga mu kunyopela kwa Annoongo. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Choonde nnyopange ili ngombole kubhoka pangali kuulala pakati ja bhenibhala bhandu bhabhangahobhalelanga Ayesu bhabhabhile ku Yudea, na lyene lihengo lyangu likombole kondeekwa na bhandu bha Annoongo bhabhabhile konokwe ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Handa apalite Annoongo mbakuhika kwaachinu kwa ntima gwa kuhachuka, ngapomolele pamo na mwangota. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Ndenda kwajopa Annoongo jwaaletite kuhengwa abhee pamo na mwangota mwabhoa. Na hibhee henela.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakwachalimianga bhandu bhangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Mbala mwangota mummanye anning'una bhitu Afoibe, yakubhe nga antumichi mu lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bha ku Kenikelea. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mumpokelange ligongo atendakunhobhalela Hangwana handa chiipalikwa kupokelewa bhandu bha Annoongo. Munnyangatile choachela chibhapakunnyopanga, kwa kubhee atekunyangatila nenga pamo na bhandu bhajingi kabhele.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Ndendakwaachalimianga akaatumichi ajangu mu Kilisito Ayesu, Apilisika pamo na Aakila. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Bhenangota bhakakoonda kujomoka ili bhaguokoange umomi gwangu. Ndendakwaachukulu bhenaangota, ngabha tu nenga jika jangu, ila kabhele kubhoka mu malubhalo ga bhandu gagaahobhalela Akilisito ga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Chalamu jangu kabhele kwa lilubhalo lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Kilisito bhabhakongana mu nyuumba yabhenji.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Mukaapekee chalamu aganja bhangu Aepeineto, jwaakibha jwakujemeka kunhobhalela Akilisito konokwe kuchilambo cha ku Asia. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Mukaapekee chalamu Amalia, jwatendite lihengo likolongwa ligongo linunji. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Mukaapekee chalamu jangu Anduloniko na Ayunia, bhenabho nga akaalongo ajangu, bhabhakatabhwa mu nyuumba ja kutabhila bhandu pamo nanenga, akaandundame bhitu bhatendakwaamanyanga bhandu bhenabho, kabhele bhakaakagula Ayesu tangu jangu nenga.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Mukaapekee chalamu Aampiliato, aganja jwangu kwa kubhee atendakwahobhalela Hangwana Ayesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Mukaapekee chalamu aganja bhangu junampala Aulubano, jwaapangana lihengo mu kwaatumikila Akilisito, kabhele munpekee chalamu jangu aganja jwangu Asitaku. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Mukaapekee chalamu jangu Aapele jwakaalengwa na kondekwa na Akilisito. Mukaapekeange chalamu jangu kwa bhoa bhabhabhile munyuumba ja Aalisitobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Mukaapekee chalamu alongo ajangu Ahelodioni, na kwa akaalongo bhoa bhabhabhile munyuumba ja Analikisi bhabhachilondanike mu Hangwana. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Mukaapekee chalamu Atilifaina na Atilifosa, bhenibhala akahikege bhatekupangana muno lihengo lya Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito. Kabhele Munchalimiange Apesisi junampala, jonojwe nga mwikege jongi jwaatekupangana muno lihengo lya Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Mwapekeange chalamu jangu Alufo. Mundu jwaatekuhagulikwa na Hangwana Ayesu, na anyongo jwabhe, hela hela kabhele nga anyongo jwangu. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Mwapekeange chalamu Asinkilito, na Afulegoni, na Ahelume, na Apatuloba, na Aheluma, pamo na bhandu bhoa bhabhahobhalela Hangwana bhabhabhilinge pamo nabho. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Mwaapekeange chalamu Afilologo na Ayulia, na Anelea na alombo bhabhe, na Aolimpa, pamo na bhandu bhoa bha Annoongo bhabhabhilinge pamo nabho.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Mchalimianange mwangota kwa mwangota kwa kulangia kubhee ntenda kupalana. Malubhalo goha gagaahobhalela Kilisito gatendakunchalimianga mwangota.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atendakujomolekea kwa malagilo gangani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Nangocheni akaalongo bhangu mmangange miho na bhenibhala bhandu bhabhannyambukia kutaukana na kwaatendanga bhandu bhangi bhalepelange kuhobhalela kwa majigano gagataukana na genigala gantekuchijigana. Nchibhekange kutali na bhandu bhenabho! <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Bhandu handa bhenaangota ngamtumikila Kilisito Hangwana bhitu, ila bhabhatendanga kwa kuchipala hilebhe, kwa malobhe gabhenji gakunyenga bhatendakwatembanga bhandu. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kila mundu atekujoa kwa ngani ja kukoonda kwinu, nanenga ndendakuhangalala muno ligongo linunji. Nambo ndendakupala mmangange na luunda mu hikubho yammbone na nkotokutendanga hikubho hibohu. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Annoongo jwaampekeanga kuhengwa ngakabha apakwaatimba Lichetani na kumpekanga machili ga kwapeta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Umbone gwa Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito gubhee na mwangota. Na hibhee henela.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Kabhele Atimoteo, jwaapangana lihengo na nenga, atendakunchalimianga. Hela hela Alukio na Ayasoni na Asosipateli, Bhayahudi akaajangu na hela hela bhatendakunchalimianga.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nenga Atelitio, jundendakujandika balua jenjeni, ndendakunchalimianga mu lina lya Hangwana.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Agayo, mundu jwaatekumandikia kwaachabhe, pamo na bhandu bhao bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhabhatekongana kwaachabhe atendakunchalimianga. Aelasito, jwaajemelela ulohi gwa chilambo heche, pamo na Akwalito anung'una bhitu jwahibhalale mu Hangwana kabhele atendakunchalimianga. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Umbone gwa Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito gubhee pamo na mwangota bhoa. Na hibhee henela.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhe gakupela ga kwaalumbalila Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Bahi, nangocheni na twaalumbalile Annoongo! Jonojwe jwaakombola kuntendanga mwangota bhakuhimalika mu kuhobhalela kwinu kupetela Ngani Jammbone jindekujitangacha kwa ngani ja Ayesu Kilisito, ngani jenejo jikachiiya kwa yaaka hijingi. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Nambo, nangocheni ukweli gonogwe gutekuhunulikwa kwa ndela ja Majandiko ga akaalondohi, na kwa Malagilo ga Annoongo gwa machobha goha pangali kupela gatekubhonekana kwa bhandu bha hilambo yoa ili bhandu bhoa bhakombole kwahobhalela na kwaakonda.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Annoongo jwaabhile jwa jika jabhe na jwaabhile na malango goha, alumbalilwe kupetela Ayesu Kilisito machobha goa pangali kupela! Na hibhee henela.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>